        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "26368317-2dae-5cee-95f9-ad3503efd66c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin DuBrow, Lance King\n- Organizations: Quiet Riot, Nightmare Records\n- Products: QR III, Terrified\n- Roles: heavy metal singers, vocalist, lead singer, record label founder\n\nFacts:\n- Kevin DuBrow was born on October 29, 1955, and he died on November 19, 2007.\n- Kevin DuBrow was an American heavy metal singer best known as the lead vocalist of Quiet Riot from 1975 to 1987 and again from 1990 until his death in 2007.\n- Lance King was born on November 23, 1962, and he is an American heavy metal vocalist specializing in melodic rock, progressive metal, and power metal.\n- In 1990, Lance King started the record label Nightmare to release his own music, and he still leads the label.\n- Lance King has sung with many groups over the last 35 years.\n- QR III was the last album to feature lead singer Kevin DuBrow until the 1993 album Terrified.",
